    source(release,'Team 254 code release discussion','Announcement and team reply on cube release','Primary team explanation','The release describes nonlinear following and spline trajectories. The team describes a low-power withdrawal option for crowded cube placement.','The published explanation does not provide a measured placement-rate comparison.')
