disconfirming_conditions=['A dedicated wide collector may win if approach error dominates cycle time and a reliable transfer is available.', 'Front and rear release lose value when routes or field access force a consistent chassis heading.', 'A shared endgame lift loses value if its structural and access costs reduce the primary scoring rate.'],
